## 3. File Formats

### `.hpub`

Claimed format:

```text
"HPB2"
| u32
| ML-KEM-EK
| u32
| P-384 point (SEC1)
```

### `.hkey`

Claimed format:

```text
"HSK2"
| m_cost u32
| t_cost u32
| lanes u32
| salt[16]
| nonce[12]
| ChaCha20-Poly1305(
      u32 | ML-KEM-DK
      ||
      u32 | P-384-scalar
  )
| tag[16]
```

AAD:

```text
everything before ciphertext
```

Passphrase protection:

```text
Argon2id
128 MiB
t = 4
lanes = ...
```

Verify all parameter handling, serialization, authentication, and parsing.

### `.hcx`

Claimed format:

```text
"HCX2"
| u32
| ML-KEM ciphertext
| u32
| ephemeral P-384 point
| base_nonce[12]

then:

    u32 length
    ciphertext
    tag[16]

    ... repeated ...
```

Nonce:

```text
nonce = base_nonce XOR counter
        counter encoded LE in final 8 bytes
```

AAD:

```text
counter(8, LE) || last_flag(1)
```

The header is included in HKDF `info`.

Verify:

* counter uniqueness
* counter overflow behavior
* nonce uniqueness
* chunk length validation
* integer overflow handling
* EOF handling
* `last_flag` semantics
* rejection of trailing data
* truncation resistance
* chunk reordering resistance
* header manipulation resistance
* malformed ciphertext handling.

